 "summary": "An amber caution: two inertial references have failed. AP, FD and A/THR are lost, the flight controls revert to alternate law (protections lost) and one PFD loses attitude unless IR 3 can replace it. With IR 1+2 failed, set ATT HDG to CAPT 3: the captain keeps attitude and the F/O PFD has none. Land in CONF 3 at VREF + 10 kt; the law becomes DIRECT when the gear goes down.",
